    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1782,
        1747,
        1907
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I know that each of the other elected officials is as interested as I am in achieving the adoption of a proper Career and Salary Plan. I urge their complete cooperation.",
